{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1433513-need-help-with-my-anti-mage","id":1433513,"title":"Need Help With My Anti-Mage","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-01-26T09:36:44-08:00","id":1433513,"title":"Need Help With My Anti-Mage","content":"Hey I been surprise made to run a mage games. First time running.<br /> <br /> I have a player who wants to be a counter spell master. He wants a spell that is like a magic damping field. So making it harder to cast magic within it and maybe make spells less powerful.<br /> He basically is a big buff guy that wants to fight other mages using his way of fighting (his fist) then dealing with fireballs.<br /> <br /> Well I have looked but I have not found anything in the books that works for this, so if there is such a spell I would be really happy to find an example.<br /> <br /> If not how should I make a spell like this, it seems like something prime should be able to do. I just doing want it to be too powerful or too weak.<ul><li>It should be a spell that allows auto clash of wills in the area of effect</li> </ul><br /> Potency could be how many times he can do the clash of will for example.<ul><li>It should something that gives a penalty to spell casting in the area of effect</li> </ul><br /> Could do the same for this as the first example. Also I could make the player choose between how many times it works and how big the penalty<br /> <br /> As im sure that there is at least one person on here who has ran mage how do you think I should do this?<br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4090-mental-state","name":"Mental-State","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-26T10:36:58-08:00","id":1433519,"title":"","content":"Prime 2 Shielding against all Supernal Magic.<br /> Duration Primary, maybe costs a Mana?<br /> Withstand: maybe? Resolve if it is Withstood, probably.<br /> Instant Cast, Advanced: Scale Area.<br /> <br /> Something like that might work to allow a Clash of Wills against every Supernal Spell, though it's not technically Counterspelling.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1452235-proin-s-legacy-hub\" target=\"_blank\">proin's Legacy hub</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2757-proindrakenzol","name":"proindrakenzol","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2757_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1514"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-26T11:00:03-08:00","id":1433520,"title":"","content":"Oooo I forgot about magic being withstood. I like the idea that maybe the magic you do cast might be nerfed a bit. So maybe a lightening bolt that has been cast with 5B does 3B in the area of effect. Do you think something like that would work?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4090-mental-state","name":"Mental-State","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-26T11:04:50-08:00","id":1433522,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mental-State</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1433513-need-help-with-my-anti-mage?p=1433520#post1433520\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Oooo I forgot about magic being withstood. I like the idea that maybe the magic you do cast might be nerfed a bit. So maybe a lightening bolt that has been cast with 5B does 3B in the area of effect. Do you think something like that would work?</div> </div> </div> </div>Sure, AOE <i>Wards and Signs</i>, would give everything in the area Withstand X, where X is Potency.<br /> <br /> [edit]Don't know how useful it would be in preventing the enemy from buffing, since I think they'd still be able to waive Withstand.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1452235-proin-s-legacy-hub\" target=\"_blank\">proin's Legacy hub</a>","edited":{"userid":2757,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2757-proindrakenzol","user":"proindrakenzol","date":". 01-26-2021, 02:07 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2757-proindrakenzol","name":"proindrakenzol","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2757_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1514"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-26T11:13:45-08:00","id":1433524,"title":"","content":"This plan is the to use Adamant Hand to whack sells off people and make it hard for them to cast more spells","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4090-mental-state","name":"Mental-State","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-26T11:20:01-08:00","id":1433526,"title":"","content":"Regarding the preventing buffs, there's always pulling a Songbird and casting AOE Supernal Dispellation with a potency of &lt;all your spells are gone&gt;<br /> <br /> On the mage discord, there's a document with some homebrew meta-casting stuff (which may or may not fly in your game), but one of the Prime 5 spells i remember was an Unmaking spell that caused a clash of wills when the subject of the spell tries to cast something.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11997-movingmind","name":"MovingMind","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"71"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-26T11:43:09-08:00","id":1433529,"title":"","content":"Other Arcana allow Shielding effects that trigger Clashes for effects under their purview (for example, Spirit 2 Ephemeral Shield). If you're feeling generous, you could allow the same thing against spells with Prime 2. However, Wards and Signs basically already serves that purpose without being so all-or-nothing.<br /> <br /> Personally, I think Prime 4 (Unraveling practice) would be required for a blanket &quot;any spells cast in the area must succeed in a Clash of wills&quot; effect.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#000080\">The longer I study science the more I am convinced that it is <span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\">functionally indistinguishable from what our ancestors would refer to as sorcery</span>. And I would know, being both scientist and sorcerer.</span>","edited":{"userid":23730,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23730-scriptorian","user":"Scriptorian","date":". 01-26-2021, 02:57 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23730-scriptorian","name":"Scriptorian","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23730_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-26T11:49:22-08:00","id":1433530,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>proindrakenzol</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1433513-need-help-with-my-anti-mage?p=1433522#post1433522\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">[edit]Don't know how useful it would be in preventing the enemy from buffing, since I think they'd still be able to waive Withstand.</div> </div> </div> </div>The only Withstand rating you can choose not to apply is that of your Resistance Attribute. Wards and Signs adds a new Withstand rating.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/410713/Bloodlines-The-Ageless\" target=\"_blank\">Bloodlines: The Ageless</a> and <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/491569/Fire--Revolution-Carthians\" target=\"_blank\">Fire &amp; Revolution: Carthians</a> on STV<br /> Some other stuff I've done: Ordo Dracul Mysteries: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1138490-idea-coil-of-owls?p=1140522\" target=\"_blank\">Mystery of Smoke</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1227848-mystery-of-%C5%BEiva-house-rule-revision\" target=\"_blank\">Revised Mystery of \u017diva</a> Mage The Awakening: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B2LMDRtfCcpdZDU1dWJzT1dNeEE/view\" target=\"_blank\">Spell Quick Reference</a> (single page and landscape for computer screens)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11887-tessie","name":"Tessie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11887_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-26T14:38:22-08:00","id":1433545,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Scriptorian</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1433513-need-help-with-my-anti-mage?p=1433529#post1433529\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Other Arcana allow Shielding effects that trigger Clashes for effects under their purview (for example, Spirit 2 Ephemeral Shield). If you're feeling generous, you could allow the same thing against spells with Prime 2. However, Wards and Signs basically already serves that purpose without being so all-or-nothing.<br /> <br /> Personally, I think Prime 4 (Unraveling practice) would be required for a blanket &quot;any spells cast in the area must succeed in a Clash of wills&quot; effect.</div> </div> </div> </div>Technically, it should be wards and signs. I don't know why it breaks the trend every other protection effect has.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/116-epimetheus","name":"Epimetheus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1758"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-26T17:41:14-08:00","id":1433559,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tessie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1433513-need-help-with-my-anti-mage?p=1433530#post1433530\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The only Withstand rating you can choose not to apply is that of your Resistance Attribute. Wards and Signs adds a new Withstand rating.</div> </div> </div> </div>That's not what the book says:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mage 2e</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">Withstanding Magic<br /> Before dice are rolled for spellcasting, the caster must consider<br /> if her subject can Withstand her magic, as it could affect the<br /> dice pool and outcome of the casting. <b>The subject of a spell can<br /> always choose not to Withstand a spell, but she must consciously<br /> choose to do so as a reflexive action.</b></div> </div> </div> </div>Says nothing about the source of that Withstand, just that it's <i>always</i> up to the subject whether they Withstand or not.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1452235-proin-s-legacy-hub\" target=\"_blank\">proin's Legacy hub</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2757-proindrakenzol","name":"proindrakenzol","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2757_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1514"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-26T18:42:00-08:00","id":1433563,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>proindrakenzol</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1433513-need-help-with-my-anti-mage?p=1433559#post1433559\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> That's not what the book says:<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Says nothing about the source of that Withstand, just that it's <i>always</i> up to the subject whether they Withstand or not.</div> </div> </div> </div>Attack spells aren't withstood.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/116-epimetheus","name":"Epimetheus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1758"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-26T18:55:37-08:00","id":1433567,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Epimetheus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1433513-need-help-with-my-anti-mage?p=1433563#post1433563\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Attack spells aren't withstood.</div> </div> </div> </div>1) How is that relevant to buff spells or the ability to waive Withstand, which was what was under discussion?<br /> <br /> 2) Have you actually read <i>Wards and Signs</i>?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1452235-proin-s-legacy-hub\" target=\"_blank\">proin's Legacy hub</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2757-proindrakenzol","name":"proindrakenzol","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2757_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1514"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-26T22:23:27-08:00","id":1433578,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>proindrakenzol</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1433513-need-help-with-my-anti-mage?p=1433567#post1433567\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> 1) How is that relevant to buff spells or the ability to waive Withstand, which was what was under discussion?<br /> <br /> 2) Have you actually read <i>Wards and Signs</i>?</div> </div> </div> </div>You can't waive withstand with wards and signs only the mage who cast it can.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/116-epimetheus","name":"Epimetheus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1758"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-27T05:22:42-08:00","id":1433602,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>proindrakenzol</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1433513-need-help-with-my-anti-mage?p=1433559#post1433559\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> That's not what the book says:<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Says nothing about the source of that Withstand, just that it's <i>always</i> up to the subject whether they Withstand or not.</div> </div> </div> </div>That's an overly literal reading that leads to obviously unintentional behaviour. <br /> The &quot;consider if her subject can Withstand her magic&quot; obviously refers to the natural Withstand built into the spell which is almost always a Resistance Attribute (or Rank for poor ephemeral entities) rather than any additional Withstand ratings added by other circumstances, and expanding the &quot;can always choose not to Withstand a spell&quot; phrasing from the normal Withstand rating that the paragraph already talks about to all types of Withstand suddenly allows you to easily bypass the Withstand ratings from Sympathetic Range and Temporal Sympathy.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/410713/Bloodlines-The-Ageless\" target=\"_blank\">Bloodlines: The Ageless</a> and <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/491569/Fire--Revolution-Carthians\" target=\"_blank\">Fire &amp; Revolution: Carthians</a> on STV<br /> Some other stuff I've done: Ordo Dracul Mysteries: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1138490-idea-coil-of-owls?p=1140522\" target=\"_blank\">Mystery of Smoke</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1227848-mystery-of-%C5%BEiva-house-rule-revision\" target=\"_blank\">Revised Mystery of \u017diva</a> Mage The Awakening: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B2LMDRtfCcpdZDU1dWJzT1dNeEE/view\" target=\"_blank\">Spell Quick Reference</a> (single page and landscape for computer screens)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11887-tessie","name":"Tessie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11887_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-27T08:23:02-08:00","id":1433619,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tessie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1433513-need-help-with-my-anti-mage?p=1433602#post1433602\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> That's an overly literal reading that leads to obviously unintentional behaviour.<br /> The &quot;consider if her subject can Withstand her magic&quot; obviously refers to the natural Withstand built into the spell which is almost always a Resistance Attribute (or Rank for poor ephemeral entities) rather than any additional Withstand ratings added by other circumstances, and expanding the &quot;can always choose not to Withstand a spell&quot; phrasing from the normal Withstand rating that the paragraph already talks about to all types of Withstand suddenly allows you to easily bypass the Withstand ratings from Sympathetic Range and Temporal Sympathy.</div> </div> </div> </div>The subject of a spell cannot waive the Withstand provided by a lack of Temporal or Spatial Sympathy for the same reason they cannot waive the Withstand provided by the Gauntlet: the Withstand provided by Temporal and Spatial Sympathy are the Withstands of Time and Space itself, just like the Gauntlet Strength is the Withstand of the Gauntlet.<br /> <br /> The Withstand provided by <i>Wards and Signs</i> is explicitly the Withstand of the subject of <i>Wards and Signs</i>.<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Epimetheus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1433513-need-help-with-my-anti-mage?p=1433578#post1433578\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You can't waive withstand with wards and signs only the mage who cast it can.</div> </div> </div> </div>Do you have a page number or dev statement to support that? Because your assertion contradicts the plain text of the book.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> But back to <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4090-mental-state\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"4090\" data-vbnamecard=\"4090\">Mental-State</a>'s question:<br /> <br /> Such a strong focus on anti-Magic and Magic dampening would probably push the Mage towards being branded a Banisher or developing a specialized Legacy (most likely both).<br /> <br /> A generalized &quot;add an additional Withstand <i>a la</i> the Gauntlet or Sympathy&quot; would probably be a Prime Weaving (Prime 3) spell, on further consideration, and would have a Mana cost. Something like:<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Spell Resistor</b><br /> Practice: Weaving<br /> Primary Factor: Potency<br /> Withstand: Resolve<br /> Cost: 1 Mana<br /> Suggested Rote Skills: Intimidation, Occult, Brawl<br /> <br /> The mage alters the very property of reality to impede the casting of spells. All spells cast by or onto (or in or into, for an area) the subject treat this spell as an additional source of Withstand with a rating equal to Potency. This does not confer a Withstand to the subject like <i>Wards and Signs</i>, instead it acts as a barrier to casting at all, similar to casting across the Gauntlet or via Temporal or Spatial Sympathy.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1452235-proin-s-legacy-hub\" target=\"_blank\">proin's Legacy hub</a>","edited":{"userid":2757,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2757-proindrakenzol","user":"proindrakenzol","date":". 01-27-2021, 11:33 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2757-proindrakenzol","name":"proindrakenzol","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2757_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1514"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-27T08:50:00-08:00","id":1433623,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>proindrakenzol</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1433513-need-help-with-my-anti-mage?p=1433619#post1433619\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Withstand provided by <i>Wards and Signs</i> is explicitly the Withstand of the subject of <i>Wards and Signs</i>.</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;When the subject is the target of a spell, that spell is Withstood with the Potency of Wards and Signs.&quot;<br /> <br /> Nowhere does it say that Wards and Signs makes the <i>subject </i>Withstand other spells; it only ever states that spells cast on the subject are Withstood by <i>Wards and Signs</i>.<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Epimetheus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1433513-need-help-with-my-anti-mage?p=1433578#post1433578\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You can't waive withstand with wards and signs only the mage who cast it can.</div> </div> </div> </div>Wards and Signs does not provide the option for the mage to apply it selectively. But I think a Reach option and/or conjunctional Fate should be able to do that.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/410713/Bloodlines-The-Ageless\" target=\"_blank\">Bloodlines: The Ageless</a> and <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/491569/Fire--Revolution-Carthians\" target=\"_blank\">Fire &amp; Revolution: Carthians</a> on STV<br /> Some other stuff I've done: Ordo Dracul Mysteries: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1138490-idea-coil-of-owls?p=1140522\" target=\"_blank\">Mystery of Smoke</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1227848-mystery-of-%C5%BEiva-house-rule-revision\" target=\"_blank\">Revised Mystery of \u017diva</a> Mage The Awakening: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B2LMDRtfCcpdZDU1dWJzT1dNeEE/view\" target=\"_blank\">Spell Quick Reference</a> (single page and landscape for computer screens)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11887-tessie","name":"Tessie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11887_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-27T09:02:06-08:00","id":1433624,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tessie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1433513-need-help-with-my-anti-mage?p=1433623#post1433623\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> &quot;When the subject is the target of a spell, that spell is Withstood with the Potency of Wards and Signs.&quot;<br /> <br /> Nowhere does it say that Wards and Signs makes the <i>subject </i>Withstand other spells; it only ever states that spells cast on the subject are Withstood by <i>Wards and Signs</i>.</div> </div> </div> </div>Even if the subject of <i>Wards and Signs</i> cannot waive the Withstand (which I don't believe to be true), <i>Wards and Signs</i> explicitly states it protects against hostile magic; a beneficial buff spell cast by the subject of <i>Wards and Signs</i> would certainly not be considered &quot;hostile&quot; to the subject of <i>Wards and Signs</i>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1452235-proin-s-legacy-hub\" target=\"_blank\">proin's Legacy hub</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2757-proindrakenzol","name":"proindrakenzol","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2757_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1514"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-27T21:23:56-08:00","id":1433679,"title":"","content":"<i>Wards and Signs</i> will not protect against any spells that grant bonuses unless the caster deliberately goes out of their way to do so. This could either mean a blanket defense against all spells (&quot;the Abyss tainted puzzle box must NOT interact with any other Practices beyond Shielding or Veiling&quot;) or bonuses only (make the Pentacle mage impossible to buff). <br /> <br /> One unorthodox application is to filter what spells can be used by Watchtower, such as only defending against those that come from the Sixth Watchtower (a great boon when hunting a Tremere) or those whose magic has no coherent Watchtower (like Scelestus). If your opponent's Path is from a Watchtower the cabal lacks, all the better.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":24280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","user":"KaiserAfini","date":". 01-28-2021, 12:36 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2648"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}